，你最想先说的是哪一小块？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2916,"promptTokens":2608,"completionTokens":188,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:34"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":31,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009706518894491376,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6733ef4429d1fd72f737b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536254889,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:34","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6733ef4429d1fd72f737b","chatId":"a49338a5a79b448b85b29e25feb0fb5a","sessionId":null,"userId":99815,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"我……没太敢这么想过。好像一直默认他一定会排斥。可你这么一说，我又觉得，他其实也没那么坏，可能只是被吓到了。<第15轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":30,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009706518894491376,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":4,"sort":6},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":3,"sort":2},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":3,"sort":4},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":3,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":3,"sort":9},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":2,"sort":1},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":2,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af6733ef4429d1fd72f737c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536254887,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:34","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNu